{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>קשורה</b> — twice in the Masorah: here and the other כי אולת קשורה בלב נער. That he is a נער, and even if he took the goblet it is because of the אולת bound in him. Or alternatively: because his אולת is bound in him, his soul must be bound to his father's soul to train him."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 44, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:23.012737868Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}